---

<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <span class="text-primary font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Nossos Pilares</span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-text-heading mt-3">
      Tecnologia, seguran&ccedil;a e suporte
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-14">
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-heading mb-3">IA Adaptativa</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Nossa IA analisa cada sess&atilde;o de acordo com a abordagem do profissional.
        TCC, Psican&aacute;lise, ACT &mdash; cada m&eacute;todo recebe um tratamento diferente.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-text-muted">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> S&iacute;ntese por abordagem</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> Artigos cient&iacute;ficos reais</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> Progress tracking autom&aacute;tico</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-heading mb-3">Seguran&ccedil;a e LGPD</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Criptografia AES-256, PIN de acesso, dados armazenados localmente no dispositivo.
        Conformidade total com a LGPD.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-text-muted">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> AES-256 + PBKDF2 100k itera&ccedil;&otilde;es</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> Autentica&ccedil;&atilde;o JWT</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> Auditoria LGPD completa</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-heading mb-3">Suporte e atualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
        App em evolu&ccedil;&atilde;o constante com novas funcionalidades.
        Canal direto com a equipe de desenvolvimento.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-text-muted">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-amber-600 mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> Atualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es frequentes</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-amber-600 mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> WhatsApp direto com a equipe</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-amber-600 mt-0.5">&#10003;</span> Roadmap p&uacute;blico no GitHub</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
